  "goodToKnow": "Wechselnd means changing or varying: wechselnde Bewölkung (variable cloud, a weather-forecast staple), in wechselnden Schichten (rotating shifts), mit wechselndem Erfolg (with mixed success). It's the present participle of wechseln (to change, switch). Wechselhaft means changeable, especially of weather or moods: wechselhaftes Aprilwetter. The Wechseljahre are the menopause, and die Wechselstube a currency exchange office."
